# CODEOWNERS — org-wide community health files.
#
# This repository holds the DEFAULT community health files for every public repo in
# unified-systems-com: a repo without its own copy inherits what is here. That makes
# these documents org-wide policy, so changes to them get owner review.
#
# PRECONDITION (learned the hard way): GitHub resolves a code owner only if that
# account has WRITE access to THIS repository. An unresolvable owner is silently
# IGNORED — not an error — so the line reads as enforcement while enforcing nothing.
# Verify after any owner change:
#   gh api repos/unified-systems-com/.github/codeowners/errors
#
# @flowingcalm steers code of conduct and governance (2026-08-26). Access lives here
# rather than on the code repo on purpose: stewarding policy documents needs write on
# the policy documents, not on the codebase.

/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md      @notgeorge @flowingcalm
/GOVERNANCE.md           @notgeorge @flowingcalm

# The published vulnerability policy — the reporting promise every repo inherits.
/SECURITY.md             @notgeorge
